            <history xml:id="history_186N200D8">
               <eventList type="performances" xml:id="eventList_5903a613">
                  <event xml:id="event_d1e426420">
                     <desc xml:id="idm96"/>
                  </event>
               </eventList>
               <p xml:id="idm97">The piano quartet was possibly written for private use in the early 1820s, when Hartmann played chamber music in the families of his later wife. At one of those gatherings, he played the violin in Kuhlau's piano quartet in C minor which might have inspired him to have a try in the same genre.</p>
            </history>
