                  <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_60a7ff48">
                     <extent xml:id="extent_39290a5d">20 pages</extent>
                     <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_5e116920">34.5 x 26</dimensions>
                     <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_b05650ae">Bound in purple card board with cloth spine. In upper left-hand corner of the cover a handwritten label inscribed: "I.P.E. <rend xml:id="idm66" rend="underline">Hartmann</rend>: / Klaverkvartet / op. 2 / Viola". Written in black ink in a different hand than the other parts. Paper: 12 staves. At the end of the music dated: "Vilh. Madsen 24/11 [19]27." Last two pages blank.</physMedium>
